{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17743","headline":"酬裴舍人见寄 · 杨巨源","name":"酬裴舍人见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁道重迁是旧班，自将霄汉比乡关。\n二妃楼下宜临水，五老祠西好看山。\n再葺吾庐心已足，每来公府路常闲。\n诗陪亚相逾三纪，石笥烟霞不共攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}